docs/page-templates.md:5:Every wiki page starts with YAML frontmatter. Fields vary by page type but always include `type`, `updated`, `sources`, and `audience`.
docs/page-templates.md:7:## Source page (`wiki/sources/<cite-key>.md`)
docs/page-templates.md:11:type: source
docs/page-templates.md:19:source_type: peer-reviewed
docs/page-templates.md:41:Pull exact figures: sample sizes, means, 95th percentiles, LODs, geographic breakdown. Include page and table references from the source markdown. Preserve units and do not round.
