codex
The second PDF is a PLOS ONE pot study using black cumin seed extract as a foliar treatment for maize grown in deliberately cadmium-spiked soil. It reports experimental maize shoot Cd accumulation, not market/food occurrence for cumin, so it is another `skip:not-food-occurrence`.
