The third PDF is a real occurrence paper: Patel et al. 2023 measured Pb, Cd, Cr, Ni, Cu, Zn, and Fe in ginger rhizome, suran rhizome, and cumin seed from Singrauli, India. The target toxic metals are reported as non-detect, while Cu/Zn/Fe have mg/kg values, so I’m putting this into the real-ingest pile and will continue triage until I have up to three real pages or hit the five-PDF slice.
