| Skin whitening | SP17 | 0.18 | 0.21 | 0.61 | 0.73 | 0.05 | 0.07 |
| All samples | Minimum | 0.08 | 0.05 | 0.10 | 0.33 | 0.02 | 0.01 |
| All samples | Maximum | 0.28 | 0.24 | 6.42 | 1.93 | 0.05 | 0.09 |

