+- The source includes ginger, but no existing `wiki/ingredients/ginger.md` slug was present. Ginger is documented in the source-page table but omitted from frontmatter routing.
+- The pre-commit hook regenerated `data/evidence/product_source_routing_audit.csv`; the commit added two routing rows for the new source.
