+# STOPPED EARLY - bounded five-PDF triage slice complete
+
+- Snapshot file: `/tmp/codex-snapshot-1780393446.txt`
+- Snapshot count at fire start: 72 PDFs in the current snapshot. The required first `wc -l /tmp/codex-snapshot-*.txt | tail -1` command printed `3030 total` because older `/tmp/codex-snapshot-*` files were present and the wildcard summed them.
+- Final auto-fetched depth: 129 PDFs. New daemon-added PDFs after the snapshot were not in this fire's scope.
+
+## Breakdown
+
+- (a) Real ingests: 1
+- (b) Dedup rollups: 0
+- (c) Skips: 4
+- (d) Escalations: 0
+
+## Triage slice
+
+- `ing-cumin-cd_2017_10-3199-iscb-12-56.pdf` - `skip:not-food-occurrence`; cumin root-meristem genotoxicity experiment with deliberate Cr/Cd/Pb salt exposure.
+- `ing-cumin-cd_2021_10-1371-journal-pone-0254602.pdf` - `skip:not-food-occurrence`; maize pot study using black cumin seed extract under cadmium-spiked soil.
+- `ing-cumin-cd_2023_10-33545-26646765-2023-v5-i2a-66.pdf` - ingested as `patel2023-singrauli-herbal-plants-metals`.
+- `ing-cumin-cd_2024_10-1007-s00344-024-11536-z.pdf` - `skip:not-food-occurrence`; black cumin germination/seed-priming study under cadmium stress.
+- `ing-cumin-ni_2017_10-36721-pjps-30-5-05-09-2017-4253-1679-1690.pdf` - `skip:not-food-occurrence`; pharmacology study of black cumin extract and serum trace elements.
+
+## Commits
+
+- `e1b319e` - `triage sweep 2026-06-02 09:52: 0 rollups + 4 skips`
+- `b0d7176` - `ingest auto-fetched 2026-06-02: patel2023-singrauli-herbal-plants-metals`
+
+## Audit
+
+- Spawned fresh-context audit agent `019e87c6-8856-72c1-b672-8dac8a150616` for `wiki/sources/patel2023-singrauli-herbal-plants-metals.md`.
+- Audit-queue rows added with `status=pending-audit-spawn-failed`: none.
+
+## Escalations
+
+- None.
+
+## Notes
+
+- `patel2023-singrauli-herbal-plants-metals` records quantified Cu, Zn, and Fe values for ginger rhizome, suran rhizome, and cumin seed. Pb, Cr, Cd, and Ni are reported as ND without LOD/LOQ, so the page labels those as screening context rather than zero-valued benchmark observations.
+- The source includes ginger, but no existing `wiki/ingredients/ginger.md` slug was present. Ginger is documented in the source-page table but omitted from frontmatter routing.
+- The pre-commit hook regenerated `data/evidence/product_source_routing_audit.csv`; the commit added two routing rows for the new source.
